OL,4,CWatchdog calls for pause on AI data    
OL,5,Ccentres in Wales                       
OL,6,GA Welsh watchdog has called for a      
OL,7,Gpause on the approval of new AI data   
OL,8,Gcentres until safeguards are in place. 
OL,10,FFuture Generations Commissioner Derek  
OL,11,FWalker said decisions about large-     
OL,12,Fscale projects should not be made      
OL,13,Fwithout their long-term impact being   
OL,14,Ftaken into account.                    
OL,16,FIt follows moves by the Welsh          
OL,17,Fgovernment to take responsibility for  
OL,18,Fthe planning process for a scheme in   
OL,19,FCardiff because of the "substantial    
OL,20,Fcontroversy" the plans had generated.  
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
