OL,4,CRob Brydon says he invented his own    
OL,5,Cfake agent to negotiate fees           
OL,6,GRob Brydon has revealed he pretended   
OL,7,Gto be his own agent at the start of    
OL,8,Ghis career when he was working as a TV 
OL,9,Gand radio presenter in Wales.          
OL,11,FThe actor, best known for playing      
OL,12,FStacey's Uncle Bryn in the hit sitcom  
OL,13,FGavin and Stacey, told BBC One's       
OL,14,FGraham Norton Show he used to step     
OL,15,Finto the role of his fake agent to     
OL,16,Farrange bookings for events.           
OL,18,F"I would get asked to go and do        
OL,19,Fthings, and I didn't really have an    
OL,20,Fagent at that time so I invented a guy 
OL,21,Fcalled Richard Knight," Brydon told    
OL,22,Fthe show.                         G4/4 
